# Imagen del servicio "web": solo la API (Fastify). El frontend se despliega
# aparte en Vercel. Se construye desde la raíz del repo por consistencia con
# el resto del proyecto, aunque solo usa backend/.

# ---- 1. Build del backend ----
FROM node:24-slim AS backend-build
WORKDIR /app/backend
RUN apt-get update -y && apt-get install -y python3 make g++ openssl && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
COPY backend/package.json backend/package-lock.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY backend/ ./
RUN npm run build

# ---- 2. Imagen final ----
FROM node:24-slim
WORKDIR /app
RUN apt-get update -y && apt-get install -y openssl && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
ENV NODE_ENV=production

COPY --from=backend-build /app/backend/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY --from=backend-build /app/backend/dist ./dist
COPY --from=backend-build /app/backend/prisma ./prisma
COPY --from=backend-build /app/backend/package.json ./package.json

EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["sh", "-c", "npx prisma migrate deploy && node dist/server.js"]
